   "en": ".{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}?{01 00 00 05 00} Um...{01 00 00 05 00}thanks\nfor bringing this to me and\nall,{01 00 00 05 00} but...{01 00 00 05 00}well...{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 17 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}\nisn't really me, y'know?{01 01 00}\nSo...why don't YOU keep it?!",
   "et": ".{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}?{01 00 00 05 00} Emm...{01 00 00 05 00}aitäh,\net sa selle mulle tõid ja\nnii,{01 00 00 05 00} aga...{01 00 00 05 00}noh...{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 17 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}\npole päris minu stiil, tead?{01 01 00}\nNii et...jäta see endale?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": ".{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 18 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Didn't I tell you?{01 01 00} Look,\nI'm only collecting\n{ff 00 00 07}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}!\nSorry, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 01 00}\n{07 00 00}Yeah, so, {01 00 00 05 00}why don't you\ntake this back?{01 00 00 0f 00} {07 16 00}{ff 00 00 04}...Like, EW!!",
   "et": ".{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 18 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Kas ma ei öelnud sulle?{01 01 00}\nKuule, ma kogun ainult\n{ff 00 00 07}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}!\nVabandust, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 01 00}\n{07 00 00}Jah, nii et, {01 00 00 05 00}miks sa ei võta\nseda tagasi?{01 00 00 0f 00} {07 16 00}{ff 00 00 04}...Nagu, ÄKH!!"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": ".{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Wow.{01 00 00 0f 00} Um...do YOU like it?{01 00 00 0f 00}\n'Cause I actually DON'T.\n\nLook,{01 00 00 0a 00} I'm only collecting\n{ff 00 00 07}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}\nThat's it. That's all.\nSo...um...{01 00 00 0a 00} Here. Take this\nback, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{01 00 00 14 00} \n{ff 00 00 04}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 07 00}Oh, BARF ME OUT THE DOOR!",
   "et": ".{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Vau.{01 00 00 0f 00} Emm...kas SULLE\nmeeldib?{01 00 00 0f 00} Sest mulle EI\nmeeldi. \nKuule,{01 00 00 0a 00} ma kogun ainult\n{ff 00 00 07}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}\nSee on kõik. Ei midagi muud.\nNii et...emm...{01 00 00 0a 00} Siin. Võta\nsee tagasi, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{01 00 00 14 00} \n{ff 00 00 04}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 07 00}Oh, MUL HAKKAB PAHA!"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": ".{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00},{01 00 00 05 00} thanks, but\nI'm done looking for\n{04 1a 00}.\nSorry, but {01 00 00 05 00}you can have it.",
   "et": "{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00},{01 00 00 05 00} aitäh, aga\nma ei otsi enam\n{04 1a 00}. Vabandust,\n{01 00 00 05 00}sa võid selle endale jätta."
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": ".{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}Oh, {01 00 00 05 00}didn't I tell you?{01 01 00} I\ndon't{01 00 00 05 00} want these anymore,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\nI'll tell you when I'm into\nsomething new, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": ".{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}Oh, {01 00 00 05 00}kas ma ei öelnud\nsulle?{01 01 00} Ma ei taha{01 00 00 05 00} neid enam,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\nMa ütlen, kui ma millessegi\nuude sattun, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "Thanks for bringing me\nthis and all, but.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00} \n\nI'm not {01 00 00 05 00}collecting these\nanymore{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}. You can have it\nback.",
   "et": "Aitäh, et sa mulle selle\ntõid ja nii, aga{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00} \n\nMa ei kogu{01 00 00 05 00} neid\nenam{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}. Sa võid selle\ntagasi võtta."
